The presentation image keeps its picture from frame to frame instead of being wiped at the first blit of each Cemu
frame. A frame that scans out only one screen, or is handed to the frontend between the two blits, left the other
screen's half blank, which blinked the TV half of the Stacked layout (Breath of the Wild). The image is cleared only
when it is created or a screen moves.

